(410, '120363042821016774@g.us', '8) INGOMA ya DAWIDI yagarutse', '\"ITANGAZO KUBARI MW\'IHWANIRO MWESE, RIGIZWE N\'AMATEGEKO Y’IHWANIRO AKURIKIRA :\"\n\nMwese abari mw\'IHWANIRO ry\'INGOMA ya DAWIDI, muramenyeshejwe ibi bikurikira :\n\nIRI HWANIRO, NIRYO KWAMAMAZA UBUTUMWA BWIZA BW\'UKURI BW\'UHORAHO NA IMANUWELI, RIKAMAMAZA KANDI INYIGISHO N\'UBUHISHUZI VY\'UKURI BIFATIYE KUVYANDITSE VY\'UKURI. IRI HWANIRO KANDI, NINIHWANIRO RYO KWAMAMAZA INGANJI Y\'IMYAKA 1000 YA IMANUWELI, IYO AGANZIRIZA MURI DAWIDI ARIWE WA MBERE NA MBERE WO MU BIKOKO BINE.\n\nRero, mur\'iri HWANIRO, ibirekuriwe n\'ibi bikurikira :\n         --------------------\n\n1) Mur\'iri HWANIRO, birarekuriwe KUBAZA no KUNGANIRA kubutumwa n\'inyigisho n\'ubuhishuzi biba vyatanzwe. \n\n2) Mur\'iri HWANIRO kandi, birarekuriwe gose KUBESHUZA no gusambura IBINYOMA mugihe wabibonye, naho vyoba ivyo wewe uvuga ko biri mubutumwa, munyigisho no mubuhishuzi biba vyatanzwe.\n\nM. N :  ARIKO UWUBESHUZA ASABWA GUKORESHA IVYANDITSE NK\'UKO IMANUWELI HAMWE NA SATANI BAHANGANIRA MUVYANDITSE NGO HANDITSE NGO.\n\n3) Mur\'iri HWANIRO kandi, birarekuriwe KUNGANIRA no kugira ico uvuze kubutumwa, n\'inyigisho n\'ubuhishuzi biba vyatanzwe.\n\n4) Mur\'iri HWANIRO kandi, biremerewe gose kwigisha mugihe ufise icigwa. Ariko aho hose wisunga IVYANDITSE vyera. \n\nAriko ufise ICIGWA ugomba gutanga canke UBUTUMWA, urabimenyesha gusa kugira tugutege yompi.\n\nM. N : KANDI, KWABA KWIGISHA, KWABA KUBESHUZA, KWABA KUNGANIRA, UMWE WESE AGERAGEZA KUBIKORA ARIKO ARAKORESHEJE IVYANDITSE VYERA VY\'AHUMETSWE N\'UHORAHO ABICISHIJE MUKANWA K\'ABAVUGISHWA NAWE.\n-----------------------------------\n\nIBIBUJIJWE NAVYO N\'IBI :\n\n1) Mur\'iri HWANIRO, birabujijwe gose kuzana imyidogo n\'amajambo yambaye ubusa atagira ico agamije gifadika.\n\n2) Mur\'iri HWANIRO kandi, birabujijwe gose GUTUKANA no GUCOKORANA. \n\nUtashimye ibihaca hamwe nibihavugigwa, ni wisokore wiviremwo utiriwe urerekana UBUSHIRASONI bwawe.\n\n3) Mur\'iri HWANIRO kandi, birabujijwe kandi gose kuzana ibintu ukuye ahandi ariko udashobora kubisigura, kiretse ufise ico ubibazako. \n\nAYA MATEGEKO TWAYASHIZEHO KUGIRANGO ATWEREKEZE INTUMBERO R\'IRI HWANIRO N\'URU', 1, '2026-03-29 23:59:49', '2026-03-29 23:59:49'),
