(452, '120363336608673142@g.us', 'HEAVEN\'S AMBASSADORS', '*Uru rubuga rwashiriweho Ingabo z\'Imana nzima zirwana ziharanira Icubahiro c\'Izina ry\'Imana yonyene, Abo nibo baserukira Imana mw\'isi, n\'abanyantegenke nk\'abandi, kandi n\'abantu basanzwe, ariko kubw\'ubuntu bwa Kristo, bagirwa abanyenkomezi bakarwana urugamba m\'uburyo bwa Mpwemu*\n\nSobanukirwa :\n\n????Kubijanye na logo y\'urubuga: ni logo ya kera yahora ikoreshwa n\'ishengero ry\'abadventiste b\'umunsi w\'indwi (igizwe n\'abamalayika 3, umunsi w\'indwi, isi)\n\n????Ibijanye n\'ama Groupe zirimwo ibi bikurikira :\n1. Bibiliya Yera (yigirwamwo Bibiliya Yera hifashishijwe inyandiko z\'abakurambere mukwizera mubisekuru vyose)\n\n2. Gospel Work, ni groupe yashiriweho gutanga link z\'amoko yose (za WhatsApp , youtube, Facebook, TikTok, instagram,...) zerekana umurimo uko uriko utera imbere.\n\n3. Iyindi Groupe iza irahindurirwa izina bivanye nuko yigirwamwo ibitabo vya Mpwemu w\'Ubuhanuzi\n\n4. Groupe ya annonce, nayo icishwamwo amasomo n\'amatangazo, n\'amanama, n\'ibigezweho cane cane kw\'ishengero ry\'abadventiste b\'umunsi w\'indwi \n\n????Uru rubuga rwemerewe kujamwo uwari we wese abishaka\n\n?? Ivyo vyose bishobora gukura Umuntu muri Mpwemu, birabujijwe!', 1, '2026-03-29 23:59:49', '2026-03-29 23:59:49'),
