(459, '120363313746563726@g.us', 'TWIVURE DUKORESHEJE ivyatsi ivyamwa  nibindi', 'AMATEGEKO YA GROUPE.\n.........................................\n1. Ibijanye na poritike ntivyemew\n\n2.Gutakana ntivyemewe \n\n3.Amastike n ama Emoji ntivyemewe.\n\n4.Ibiterasoni ntivyemewe ngaha \n\n5.Kubahiriza iciyumviro c uwundi nivyiz.\n\n6.Kuvuga muri groupe ningombwa \n\n7.Uwubajije atararonka inyishu ararindira akazoronswa inyishu.\n\n8.Ama Audio nokwandika ubutumw bugufi biremewe.\n\n9.Gusanga Admin mur imbogisi kubimusaba mubugwaneza,ntakibazo.\n\n10.Gutanga umuti muri groupe wizewe neza,uzi neza ukaba uwufitiye ubuhamya,biremewe.\n\n11.Gutanga inyunganizi muri groupe biremewe.\n\n12.Uwukoze ibinyurany n amategek ya groupe,arenzwa urupangu.', 1, '2026-03-29 23:59:49', '2026-03-29 23:59:49'),
