nt-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->La divulgation des performances ESG</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.5pt 22.55pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->La traçabilité de l\'utilisation des fonds pour le capital institutionnel</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt 22.55pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->La mesure de l\'impact et son rapport aligné sur les métriques de durabilité</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">NUFOTEC maintient une tolérance zéro envers la fraude, la corruption, les achats contraires à l\'éthique ou la non-conformité réglementaire.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">(4) Assurance pour les investisseurs et donateurs</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Nos systèmes de gouvernance et de conformité sont conçus pour garantir que le capital déployé dans l\'installation NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES :</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Est protégé par une supervision structurée</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Est alloué conformément aux jalons stratégiques approuvés</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.5pt 27pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Est suivi à travers des indicateurs de performance ESG et financiers mesurables<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Est rapporté de manière transparente aux actionnaires</strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">(5) Déclaration de positionnement stratégique pour l\'investissement</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">L\'installation NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES est structurée par African Green Farmers Limited en tant que plateforme industrielle bancable, prête pour l\'audit, alignée sur les critères ESG et capable d\'absorber les capitaux institutionnels de manière responsable tout en générant des rendements environnementaux, sociaux et financiers mesurables.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Notre cadre de gouvernance réduit les risques systémiques, renforce l\'acceptation réglementaire et améliore la crédibilité sur les marchés internationaux &ndash; positionnant NUFOTEC comme un partenaire de confiance pour un investissement à long terme et axé sur l\'impact.</span></strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>', '<h2 style=\"margin-left: -0.25pt; padding-left: 120px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">(1)<span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Governance, compliance and transparency</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">NUFOTEC is committed to strong corporate governance, regulatory compliance and financial transparency as fundamental pillars of sustainable industrial growth.<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"> </strong>The deployment of over USD 40 million in seed capital prioritizes GMP (Good Manufacturing Practices) compliant infrastructure, ISO certification systems (<span style=\"line-height: 103%;\">ISO 9001, 22000, 14001, 45001 and 14644</span>), annual independent financial audits, ESG (Environmental, Social and Governance) performance reporting, risk oversight and board-level governance structures, thereby ensuring accountability and institutional integrity.<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"> </strong></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h5 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 320px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Governance commitments:</span></em></span></h5>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Full GMP implementation and documentation</span></strong></span></em></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><!--[endif]-->Completion of the ISO certification roadmap</span></em></span></strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><!--[endif]-->Annual independent financial audits</span></em></span></strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><!--[endif]-->ESG performance monitoring and reporting</span></em></span></strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><!--[endif]-->Structured compliance and risk management systems</span></em></span></strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">(2)<span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Institutional oversight and accountability</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">NUFOTEC operates under a structured corporate governance model that ensures:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.55pt 27pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Clear separation between shareholders, the Board of Directors and General Management</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Defined fiduciary responsibilities and delegation of authority frameworks</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Independent advisory expertise in regulatory sciences, finance, ESG and risk management</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.15pt 27pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Structured board oversight of strategy, compliance and capital allocation</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">This governance framework aligns with international best practices recognized by institutions such as the International Finance Corporation and the World Bank.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 200px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">(2) Regulatory compliance, quality assurance and authorizations</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">NUFOTEC builds an integrated compliance ecosystem aligned with recognized international standards, including but not limited to:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 9001 - Quality Management System</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 22000 - Food Safety</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.5pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 14001 - Environmental Governance and Sustainability</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.3pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 45001 - Occupational Health and Safety</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 15.35pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 14644 - Cleanroom Qualification<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 102%; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Our production roadmap integrates Good Manufacturing Practices (GMP), </span></strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 102%; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">validated laboratory systems, traceability controls, and regulatory documentation protocols required for regional and international export markets of TCAMs, </span></strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 102%; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Nutraceuticals/Dietary Supplements, Phytomedicines and Phytopharmaceuticals, clean-label fortified health foods and fruit drinks.</span></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 102%; margin: 0cm 0cm .2pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></