none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Impact measurement and reporting aligned with sustainability metrics</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">NUFOTEC maintains zero tolerance for fraud, corruption, unethical procurement or regulatory non-compliance.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">(4) Assurance for investors and donors</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Our governance and compliance systems are designed to ensure that the capital deployed in the NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES facility:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Is protected by structured oversight</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Is allocated according to approved strategic milestones</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.5pt 27pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Is tracked through measurable ESG and financial performance indicators<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Is reported transparently to shareholders</strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">(5) Strategic investment positioning statement</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES facility is structured by African Green Farmers Limited as a bankable, audit-ready, ESG-aligned industrial platform capable of responsibly absorbing institutional capital while generating measurable environmental, social and financial returns.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Our governance framework reduces systemic risks, strengthens regulatory acceptance and enhances credibility in international markets – positioning NUFOTEC as a trusted partner for long-term, impact-driven investment.</span></strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>', '<h2 style=\"margin-left: -0.25pt; padding-left: 120px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">(1)<span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Utawala, utiifu na uwazi</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">NUFOTEC imejitolea kwa utawala imara wa shirika, utiifu wa udhibiti na uwazi wa kifedha kama nguzo za msingi za ukuaji endelevu wa viwanda.<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"> </strong>Upelekaji wa zaidi ya USD milioni 40 ya mtaji wa awali unapeana kipaumbele kwa miundombinu inayozingatia GMP (Mazoezi Bora ya Utengenezaji), mifumo ya uidhinishaji wa ISO (<span style=\"line-height: 103%;\">ISO 9001, 22000, 14001, 45001 na 14644</span>), ukaguzi wa kifedha huru wa kila mwaka, ripoti ya utendaji wa ESG (Mazingira, Jamii na Utawala), usimamizi wa hatari na miundo ya utawala katika ngazi ya bodi, na hivyo kuhakikisha uwajibikaji na uadilifu wa kitaasisi.<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"> </strong></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h5 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 320px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Ahadi za utawala:</span></em></span></h5>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Utekelezaji kamili wa GMP na nyaraka</span></strong></span></em></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><!--[endif]-->Kukamilisha ramani ya uidhinishaji wa ISO</span></em></span></strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><!--[endif]-->Ukaguzi huru wa kifedha wa kila mwaka</span></em></span></strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><!--[endif]-->Ufuatiliaji na ripoti ya utendaji wa ESG</span></em></span></strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><!--[endif]-->Mifumo iliyoundwa ya utiifu na usimamizi wa hatari</span></em></span></strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">(2)<span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Usimamizi wa kitaasisi na uwajibikaji</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Kampuni ya NUFOTEC inafanya kazi chini ya muundo wa utawala wa shirika uliobuniwa ambao unahakikisha:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.55pt 27pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Mgawanyo wa wazi kati ya wanahisa, Bodi ya Wakurugenzi na Usimamizi Mkuu</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Majukumu ya uaminifu yaliyobainishwa na mifumo ya ugawaji wa mamlaka</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Utaalam wa ushauri huru katika sayansi ya udhibiti, fedha, ESG na usimamizi wa hatari</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.15pt 27pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Usimamizi ulioundwa wa bodi wa mkakati, utiifu na ugawaji wa mtaji</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Muundo huu wa utawala unalingana na mbinu bora za kimataifa zinazotambuliwa na taasisi kama vile Shirika la Fedha la Kimataifa na Benki ya Dunia.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 200px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">(2) Utiifu wa udhibiti, uhakikisho wa ubora na idhini</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">NUFOTEC inajenga mfumo ikolojia wa utiifu uliojumuishwa unaolingana na viwango vya kimataifa vinavyotambuliwa, ikijumuisha lakini sio tu:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 9001 - Mfumo wa Usimamizi wa Ubora</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 22000 - Usalama wa Chakula</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.5pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 14001 - Utawala wa Mazingira na Uendelevu</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.3pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 45001 - Afya na Usalama Kazini</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 15.35pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 14644 - Uhitimu wa Chumba Safi<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 102%; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Ramani yetu ya utengenezaji inajumuisha Mazoezi Bora ya Utengenezaji (GMP), </span></strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 102%; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">mifumo iliyothibitishwa ya maabara, udhibiti wa ufuatiliaji, na itifaki za nyaraka za udhibiti zinazohitajika kwa masoko ya usafirishaji ya kikanda na kimataifa ya TCAMs, </span></strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 102%; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Virutubisho/Viongeza vya Lishe, Dawa za Mimea na Dawa za Mimea, vyakula vya afya vilivyoimarishwa lebo-safi na vinywaji vya matunda.</span></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 102%; margin: 0cm 0cm .2pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0