line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Perimeter security, CCTV cameras, community engagement, access controls</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9; height: 32.75pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.31034%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor black black; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 32.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"37\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 3.95pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>9</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8161%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 32.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt .8pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Unexpected losses (climate, market, fire)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.8736%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 32.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"329\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt .85pt;\"><strong>Crop and asset insurance, contingency funds, prudent financial planning</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10; height: 48.75pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.31034%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor black black; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"37\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 1.55pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>10</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8161%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt .1pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Macroeconomic and Foreign Exchange Risks: Currency fluctuations, inflation, and import constraints</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.8736%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"329\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; tab-stops: center 154.0pt right 239.95pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>USD-denominated <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>exports, <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>multi-</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>currency accounts, and natural hedging</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 11; height: 48.85pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.31034%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor black black; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"37\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 1.55pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>11</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8161%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt .1pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Political and Regulatory Risks: Policy shifts, licensing delays, and taxation changes</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.8736%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"329\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 3.6pt .0001pt 0cm;\"><strong>Proactive engagement with regulators, legal advisory, and diversification across markets</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 12; height: 48.7pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.31034%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor black black; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.7pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"37\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 1.55pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>12</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8161%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.7pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt .1pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Supply Chain Risks: Variability in raw materials and potential cooperative defaults</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.8736%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.7pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"329\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 3.65pt .0001pt 0cm;\"><strong>contractual suppliers, local cooperatives, quality pre-testing, and multiple sourcing options</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 13; height: 48.85pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.31034%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor black black; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"37\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 1.55pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>13</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8161%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt .1pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Governance and Capital Risks: Misallocation or weak controls</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.8736%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"329\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>milestone-based <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>disbursement, segregated accounts, IFRS-aligned audits, and investor oversight</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 14; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; height: 48.85pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.31034%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor black black; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"37\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 1.55pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>14</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8161%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt .1pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Market Access Risks: Payment delays and counterfeit products</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.8736%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"329\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Pre-offtake <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"> </span>agreements, <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"> </span>digital traceability, and diversified distribution channels.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', NULL, NULL, 0, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 2, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', '', NULL, '2026-03-24 21:39:07', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `sections_contenu` (`id_section`, `id_page`, `type_section`, `titre_section`, `titre_section_fr`, `titre_section_en`, `titre_section_sw`, `sous_titre`, `sous_titre_fr`, `sous_titre_en`, `sous_titre_sw`, `contenu_texte`, `contenu_texte_fr`, `contenu_texte_en`, `contenu_texte_sw`, `image_url`, `image_droite`, `bouton_texte`, `bouton_texte_fr`, `bouton_texte_en`, `bouton_texte_sw`, `bouton_lien`, `ordre`, `created_at`, `custom_class`, `options_json`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `est_active`) VALUES
(180, 19, 'texte', 'Nos services', NULL, 'Our services', 'Huduma zetu', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NUFOTEC offre une plateforme multicanal combinant des services de santé réglementés, la nutrition préventive, l\'accès à la santé numérique et l\'autonomisation économique des communautés. Toutes les activités cliniques sont menées conformément aux réglementations nationales applicables et alignées sur les cadres de supervision de l\'Autorité de réglementation.', NULL, 'NUFOTEC offers a multi-channel platform combining regulated health services, preventive nutrition, digital health access, and community economic empowerment. All clinical activities are conducted in accordance with applicable national regulations and aligned with the supervision frameworks of the Regulatory Authority.', 'NUFOTEC inatoa jukwaa la njia nyingi linalochanganya huduma za afya zilizodhibitiwa, lishe ya kuzuia, upatikanaji wa afya dijitali, na uwezeshaji wa kiuchumi wa jamii. Shughuli zote za kliniki zinafanywa kwa kufuata kanuni za kitaifa zinazotumika na kulingana na mifumo ya usimamizi ya Mamlaka ya Udhibiti.', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(181, 19, 'liste', '1) Services de consultation clinique', NULL, '1) Clinical consultation services', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Consultations sur place fournies par des médecins agréés et des nutritionnistes/diététiciens diplômés, offrant des évaluations de santé préventives, des conseils nutritionnels et un soutien botanique intégratif dans le cadre réglementaire via nos cliniques de phytothérapie.', NULL, 'On-site consultations provided by licensed physicians and graduate nutritionists/dietitians, offering preventive health assessments, nutritional advice, and integrative botanical support within the regulatory framework via our herbal medicine clinics.', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(182, 19, 'liste', '2) Télésanté et services de santé numériques', NULL, '2) Telehealth and digital health services', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Consultations à distance par téléphone et vidéo, systèmes structurés d\'admission numérique et assistance via l\'IA à travers la plateforme \"NUFOTEC ONE\" pour élargir l\'accès aux communautés mal desservies.', NULL, 'Remote consultations by phone and video, structured digital admission systems, and AI-powered assistance through the \"NUFOTEC ONE\" platform to expand access to underserved communities.', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(183, 19, 'liste', '3) Éducation à la nutrition préventive et à la santé publique', NULL, '3) Preventive nutrition and public health education', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Programmes d\'éducation communautaires et numériques axés sur la nutrition préventive, l\'amélioration du mode de vie et les pratiques de bien-être sécuritaires, dispensés via des ateliers, des diffusions médiatiques et des plateformes numériques.', NULL, 'Community and digital education programs focused on preventive nutrition, lifestyle improvement, and safe wellness practices, delivered through workshops, media broadcasts, and digital platforms.', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(184, 19, 'liste', '4) Services de développement agricole et de renforcement des capacités', NULL, '4) Agricultural development and capacity building services', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Formation à l\'agriculture biologique, à la culture de plantes médicinales, à la gestion post-récolte et à la transformation agroalimentaire à petite échelle pour renforcer les chaînes de valeur rurales et l\'intégrité de l\'approvisionnement.', NULL, 'Training in organic farming, medicinal plant cultivation, post-harvest management, and small-scale agro-processing to strengthen rural value chains and supply integrity.', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(185, 19, 'liste', '5) Services d\'entrepreneuriat et d\'autonomisation économique', NULL, '5) Entrepreneurship and economic empowerment services', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mobilisation communautaire vers l\'auto-emploi et les entreprises génératrices de revenus par le biais de programmes de sensibilisation structurés, de la sensibilisation numérique et de l\'intégration dans la chaîne de valeur.', NULL, 'Community mobilization toward self-employment and income-generating enterprises through structured outreach programs, digital awareness, and value chain integration.', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 6, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(186, 19, 'liste', '6) Services de médias et de publicité numérique', NULL, '6) Media and digital advertising services', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Services de publicité et de promotion payants sur les plateformes numériques et de diffusion d\'NUFOTEC pour soutenir les PME tout en générant des flux de revenus durables.', NULL, 'Paid advertising and promotion services on NUFOTEC\'s digital and broadcast platforms to support SMEs while generating sustainable revenue streams.', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 7, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(187, 19, 'texte', 'Impact stratégique', NULL, 'Strategic impact', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ce modèle de service intégré renforce l\'accès aux soins de santé, promeut le bien-être préventif, soutient la croissance des PME et améliore les résultats de développement alignés sur les critères ESG, tout en diversifiant la base de revenus d\'NUFOTEC.', NULL, 'This integrated service model strengthens healthcare access, promotes preventive wellness, supports SME growth, and improves development outcomes aligned with ESG criteria, while diversifying NUFOTEC\'s revenue base.', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 8, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(188, 2, 'liste', 'Fiche d\'information du projet', NULL, 'Project fact sheet', NULL, 'Titre du projet : Installation de fabrication intégrée de phytopharmaceutiques et de nutraceutiques NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES', NULL, 'Project title: NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES integrated phytopharmaceutical and nutraceutical manufacturing facility', NULL, '<p>Entité promotrice : African Green Farmers Ltd (NUFOTEC)<br>Localisation :<br>Adresse enregistrée :<br>Téléphone :<br>E-mails :</p>', NULL, '<p>Promoting entity: African Green Farmers Ltd (NUFOTEC)<br>Location:<br>Registered address:<br>Phone:<br>Emails:</p>', NULL, '/attachments/Sections/2026022713304969a180696a90d.jpg', 0, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 1, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', '', NULL, '2026-03-02 14:14:24', '2026-03-02 14:14:24', 1),
(189, 1, 'image_texte', 'NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES – Industrialisation de l\'économie des plantes médicinales en Afrique', NULL, 'NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES – Industrializing Africa\'s medicinal plant economy', NULL, 'INVESTISSEZ EN NOUS OU DEVENEZ NOTRE COURTIER CONTRACTUEL DÈS AUJOURD\'HUI !?', NULL, 'INVEST IN US OR BECOME OUR CONTRACTUAL BROKER TODAY!?', NULL, '<p><strong>Avec plus de 40 millions USD de capital d\'amorçage dans le cadre de la vision quinquennale (Vision 2026-2031), NUFOTEC Limited est une entreprise de biotechnologie agro-industrielle privée, intégrée verticalement, basée au Burundi, qui s\'emploie régulièrement à transformer l\'agriculture biologique commerciale de plantes médicinales ciblées et sélectionnées, de cultures fonctionnelles, de fruits et de ressources agricoles riches en nutriments en MTCAs standardisées à base de plantes (Médecines Traditionnelles, Complémentaires et Alternatives), en Nutraceutiques/Compléments Alimentaires, en produits alimentaires et boissons santé fortifiés clean-label totalement exempts de sucres et de produits chimiques nocifs ajoutés, en engrais organiques haute-nutrition ainsi qu\'en formulations phyto-médicinales et phyto-pharmaceutiques scientifiquement avancées soumises à des essais précliniques et cliniques via notre laboratoire de recherche scientifique et notre installation d\'élevage d\'animaux de laboratoire. En intégrant l\'agriculture biologique commerciale climato-intelligente, des réseaux structurés d\'agriculteurs sous contrat, le profilage de produits piloté par le laboratoire, la standardisation, les essais précliniques et cliniques, et une infrastructure de transformation scalable, NUFOTEC fait passer l\'agriculture d\'une production de matières premières à faible marge à une agriculture industrielle et une fabrication à haute valeur ajoutée. L\'entreprise construit une plateforme de croissance conçue pour étendre la superficie cultivée, augmenter la capacité de transformation, renforcer la pénétration des exportations régionales et générer un emploi durable, en particulier pour les jeunes et les femmes, tout en contribuant à la transformation économique du Burundi et au développement de la chaîne de valeur de la santé naturelle.</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nous visons un chiffre d\'affaires annuel de plusieurs millions de dollars, une performance EBITDA durable et une expansion des exportations scalable d\'ici 2031 (Vision 2026-2031).</p>\r\n<p><strong>En bref :</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>L\'installation de NUFOTEC fabrique les produits standard et conformes aux BPF suivants :</strong></p>\r\n<p>A) MTCAs (Médecines Traditionnelles, Complémentaires et Alternatives), ciblant les maladies aiguës et chroniques ;</p>\r\n<p>B) Nutraceutiques/Compléments Alimentaires ciblant les maladies aiguës et chroniques ;</p>\r\n<p>C) Produits alimentaires et boissons santé fortifiés clean-label pour la prévention et la lutte contre la malnutrition, en particulier chez les enfants, les femmes enceintes et les mères allaitantes ;</p>\r\n<p>D) Engrais organiques haute-nutrition pour la régénération et l\'enrichissement des sols ;</p>\r\n<p>E) Phytomédicaments, ciblant les maladies aiguës et chroniques ;</p>\r\n<p>F) Phytopharmaceutiques, ciblant les maladies aiguës et chroniques.</p>\r\n<figure class=\"table\"></figure>', NULL, '<p><strong>With over USD 40 million in seed capital under the five-year vision (Vision 2026-2031), NUFOTEC Limited is a private, vertically integrated agro-industrial biotechnology company based in Burundi, regularly engaged in transforming commercial organic farming of targeted and selected medicinal plants, functional crops, fruits, and nutrient-rich agricultural resources into standardized TCAMs (Traditional, Complementary and Alternative Medicines), Nutraceuticals/Dietary Supplements, clean-label fortified health food and beverage products totally free of added sugars and harmful chemicals, high-nutrition organic fertilizers, as well as scientifically advanced phyto-medicinal and phyto-pharmaceutical formulations submitted to preclinical and clinical trials via our scientific research laboratory and laboratory animal breeding facility. By integrating climate-smart commercial organic farming, structured contract farmer networks, laboratory-driven product profiling, standardization, preclinical and clinical trials, and scalable processing infrastructure, NUFOTEC moves agriculture from low-margin raw material production to industrial agriculture and high-value manufacturing. The company is building a growth platform designed to expand cultivated area, increase processing capacity, strengthen regional export penetration, and generate sustainable employment, particularly for youth and women, while contributing to Burundi\'s economic transformation and the natural health value chain development.</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>We target multi-million dollar annual revenue, sustainable EBITDA performance, and scalable export expansion by 2031 (Vision 2026-2031).</p>\n<p><strong>In brief:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>NUFOTEC facility manufactures the following GMP-compliant standard products:</strong></p>\n<p>A) TCAMs (Traditional, Complementary and Alternative Medicines), targeting acute and chronic diseases;</p>\n<p>B) Nutraceuticals/Dietary Supplements targeting acute and chronic diseases;</p>\n<p>C) Clean-label fortified health food and beverage products for the prevention and fight against malnutrition, especially in children, pregnant women, and breastfeeding mothers;</p>\n<p>D) High-nutrition organic fertilizers for soil regeneration and enrichment;</p>\n<p>E) Phytomedicines, targeting acute and chronic diseases;</p>\n<p>F) Phytopharmaceuticals, targeting acute and chronic diseases.</p>', NULL, '/attachments/Sections/b2304a36e41cf889f9858d8873b9ac2c.jpg', 1, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 1, '2026-03-01 15:44:47', 'image_texte', NULL, '2026-03-11 10:03:59', NULL, 1),
(192, 1, 'liste', 'Notre valeur ajoutée', NULL, 'Our added value', NULL, 'Pourquoi choisir notre plateforme de téléconsultation ?', NULL, 'Why choose our teleconsultation platform?', NULL, '<ul>\r\n <li>Consultations rapides disponibles 7 jours sur 7</li>\r\n <li>Professionnels de santé qualifiés et certifiés</li>\r\n <li>Plateforme 100 % sécurisée et confidentielle</li>\r\n  <li>Prise de rendez-vous facile en quelques clics</li>\r\n  <li>Accessible depuis mobile, tablette et ordinateur<br />\r\n &nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', NULL, '<ul>\n<li>Fast consultations available 7 days a week</li>\n<li>Qualified and certified healthcare professionals</li>\n<li>100% secure and confidential platform</li>\n<li>Easy appointment booking in a few clicks</li>\n<li>Accessible from mobile, tablet, and computer<br />\n&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, 0, 'Prendre Rendez-Vous', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 2, '2026-03-01 18:42:17', '', NULL, '2026-03-01 18:45:15', NULL, 1),
(194, 2, 'liste_card', 'Fiche d\'information du projet', NULL, 'Project fact sheet', NULL, 'Fiche d\'information du projet', NULL, 'Project fact sheet', NULL, '<div class=\"fact-value\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt;\">Titre du projet :</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt;\"> Installation de fabrication int&eacute;gr&eacute;e de phytopharmaceutiques et de nutraceutiques NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES</span></li>\r\n<li><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; color: black;\">Entit&eacute; promotrice :</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; color: black;\"> African Green Farmers Ltd (NUFOTEC) </span></li>\r\n<li><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; color: black;\">Localisation :</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 106%;\">Adresse enregistr&eacute;e :</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></li>\r\n<li><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 106%;\">T&eacute;l&eacute;phone : +257 79 666 439</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 106%; color: windowtext;\">E-mails : nufotecburundi2026@gmail.com</span></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 106%; color: windowtext;\">Site web :</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 106%; color: windowtext;\"> www.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">nufotec.com</span></span></li>\r\n<li><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 106%; color: windowtext;\">Secteur :</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 106%; color: windowtext;\"> Fabrication pharmaceutique et standardisation botanique</span></li>\r\n<li><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 106%; color: windowtext;\">Besoins totaux en capital d\'amor&ccedil;age :</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 106%; color: windowtext;\"> Plus de 40 millions USD</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>', NULL, '<div class=\"fact-value\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt;\">Project title:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt;\"> NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES integrated phytopharmaceutical and nutraceutical manufacturing facility</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt;\">Promoting entity:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt;\"> African Green Farmers Ltd (NUFOTEC) </span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt;\">Location:</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt;\">Registered address:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt;\"> </span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt;\">Phone: +257 79 666 439</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt;\">Emails: nufotecburundi2026@gmail.com</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt;\">Website:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt;\"> www.nufotec.com</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt;\">Sector:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt;\"> Pharmaceutical manufacturing and botanical standardization</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt;\">Total seed capital needs:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt;\"> Over USD 40 million</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>', NULL, NULL, 0, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 2, '2026-03-01 20:10:58', 'fact-sheet-section', '[ {\"icon\": \"building\", \"title\": \"Titre du projet\", \"description\": \"Installation de fabrication intégrée de phytopharmaceutiques et de nutraceutiques NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES\"}, {\"icon\": \"briefcase\", \"title\": \"Entité promotrice\", \"description\": \"African Green Farmers Ltd (NUFOTEC)\"}, {\"icon\": \"geo-alt\", \"title\": \"Localisation\", \"description\": \"Zambie\"}, {\"icon\": \"envelope\", \"title\": \"Contact\", \"description\": \"info@africangreenfarmers.com\"}, {\"icon\": \"globe\", \"title\": \"Site web\", \"description\": \"www.africangreenfarmers.com\"}, {\"icon\": \"tag\", \"title\": \"Secteur\", \"description\": \"Fabrication pharmaceutique et standardisation botanique\"}, {\"icon\": \"cash-stack\", \"title\": \"Besoins totaux en capital d\'amorçage\", \"description\": \"Plus de 40 millions USD\", \"highlight\": true} ]', '2026-03-24 20:47:58', NULL, 1),
(197, 2, 'liste_card', 'Énoncé de vision, énoncé de mission et positionnement stratégique', NULL, 'Vision statement, mission statement and strategic positioning', NULL, 'Énoncé de vision, énoncé de mission et positionnement stratégique', NULL, 'Vision statement, mission statement and strategic positioning', NULL, '<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Énoncé de vision : </strong></span><strong><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Devenir un modèle zambien de premier plan dans l\'agriculture à grande échelle sans produits chimiques de cultures biologiques et de plantes médicinales et une plateforme industrielle pour la fabrication de MTCAs innovantes et standardisées, de Nutraceutiques/Compléments Alimentaires, de phytomédicaments et de</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">phytopharmaceutiques soumis à des essais précliniques et cliniques via notre laboratoire de recherche scientifique et notre installation d\'élevage d\'animaux de laboratoire, d\'engrais organiques haute-nutrition ainsi que de produits alimentaires et boissons santé fortifiés clean-label - reconnu à travers le continent africain et mondialement pour sa qualité, sa sécurité et sa durabilité, et sa contribution à la transformation socioéconomique durable.</span></span></em></strong></li>\r\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">Énoncé de mission :</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> </span></em></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"><strong><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Pratiquer l\'agriculture biologique à grande échelle de plantes médicinales clés, de cultures fonctionnelles, de fruits et légumes sur plus de 2000 hectares de terres agricoles et transformer la récolte en MTCAs, Nutraceutiques/Compléments Alimentaires, phytomédicaments et phytopharmaceutiques conformes aux BPF et aux normes ISO, soumis à des essais précliniques et cliniques via notre laboratoire de recherche scientifique et notre installation d\'élevage d\'animaux de laboratoire, ainsi qu\'en produits alimentaires et boissons santé fortifiés clean-label et en engrais organiques haute-nutrition.</span></em><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"> </span></strong></span></li>\r\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">Positionnement stratégique :</span><em> </em></span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; color: black;\">AFRICAN GREEN FARMERS LIMITED est positionnée comme une entreprise agro-industrielle intégrée verticalement axée sur les cultures médicinales et fonctionnelles à haute valeur ajoutée. Grâce à des partenariats structurés, à la valorisation et à une transformation orientée vers l\'exportation, l\'entreprise transforme l\'agriculture biologique commerciale en produits industriels scalables (MTCAs, Nutraceutiques/Compléments Alimentaires, phytomédicaments et phytopharmaceutiques soumis à des essais précliniques et cliniques via notre laboratoire de recherche scientifique et notre installation d\'élevage d\'animaux de laboratoire, ainsi qu\'en produits alimentaires et boissons santé fortifiés clean-label).</span></em></strong></li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Vision statement: </strong></span><strong><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">To become a leading Zambian model in large-scale chemical-free farming of organic crops and medicinal plants and an industrial platform for the manufacturing of innovative and standardized TCAMs, Nutraceuticals/Dietary Supplements, phytomedicines and </span><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">phytopharmaceuticals submitted to preclinical and clinical trials via our scientific research laboratory and laboratory animal breeding facility, high-nutrition organic fertilizers as well as clean-label fortified health food and beverage products - recognized across the African continent and globally for its quality, safety and sustainability, and its contribution to sustainable socioeconomic transformation.</span></span></em></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">Mission statement:</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> </span></em></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"><strong><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">To practice large-scale organic farming of key medicinal plants, functional crops, fruits and vegetables on over 2000 hectares of agricultural land and transform the harvest into GMP and ISO compliant TCAMs, Nutraceuticals/Dietary Supplements, phytomedicines and phytopharmaceuticals submitted to preclinical and clinical trials via our scientific research laboratory and laboratory animal breeding facility, as well as clean-label fortified health food and beverage products and high-nutrition organic fertilizers.</span></em><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"> </span></strong></span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">Strategic positioning:</span><em> </span></em><em><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; color: black;\">AFRICAN GREEN FARMERS LIMITED is positioned as a vertically integrated agro-industrial company focused on high-value medicinal and functional crops. Through structured partnerships, valorization and export-oriented processing, the company transforms commercial organic farming into scalable industrial products (TCAMs, Nutraceuticals/Dietary Supplements, phytomedicines and phytopharmaceuticals submitted to preclinical and clinical trials via our scientific research laboratory and laboratory animal breeding facility, as well as clean-label fortified health food and beverage products).</span></em></strong></li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, 0, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 1, '2026-03-01 20:49:25', 'milestones-timeline', '{\r\n    \"columns\": 3,\r\n    \"show_icons\": true,\r\n    \"icon\": \"lightbulb\",\r\n    \"icon_color\": \"warning\",\r\n    \"bg_color\": \"white\",\r\n    \"shadow\": true,\r\n    \"border\": true,\r\n    \"rounded\": \"lg\",\r\n    \"hover_effect\": \"lift\",\r\n    \"text_align\": \"center\",\r\n    \"section_bg\": \"#f8f9fa\"\r\n}', '2026-03-04 15:31:11', '2026-03-04 15:31:11', 1);
INSERT INTO `sections_contenu` (`id_section`, `id_page`, `type_section`, `titre_section`, `titre_section_fr`, `titre_section_en`, `titre_section_sw`, `sous_titre`, `sous_titre_fr`, `sous_titre_en`, `sous_titre_sw`, `contenu_texte`, `contenu_texte_fr`, `contenu_texte_en`, `contenu_texte_sw`, `image_url`, `image_droite`, `bouton_texte`, `bouton_texte_fr`, `bouton_texte_en`, `bouton_texte_sw`, `bouton_lien`, `ordre`, `created_at`, `custom_class`, `options_json`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `est_active`) VALUES
(198, 2, 'texte', '10. Objectifs stratégiques spécifiques (2026–2031)', NULL, '10. Specific strategic objectives (2026–2031)', NULL, '10. Objectifs stratégiques spécifiques (2026–2031)', NULL, '10. Specific strategic objectives (2026–2031)', NULL, '<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">10. Objectifs stratégiques spécifiques (2026&ndash;2031)</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">10.1. Objectif d\'expansion de l\'agriculture biologique commerciale</h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Développer la culture biologique commerciale climato-intelligente de cultures médicinales et fonctionnelles à haute valeur ajoutée.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Phase I (2026&ndash;2027)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Opérationnaliser les 90 hectares déjà acquis.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 51.5pt .85pt 18.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&uuml;</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Cultiver des plantes médicinales prioritaires, notamment Carica papayaya et l\'aloe vera <span style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&uuml;</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Mettre en place des systèmes d\'irrigation, de gestion post-récolte et de séchage.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Phase II (2028&ndash;2031)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Expansion à plus de 2 000 hectares (exploitation propre + agriculture contractuelle).</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Intégrer plus de 5 000 producteurs sous contrat.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 2.0pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Atteindre la conformité biologique certifiée (normes régionales/internationales).</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Mettre en œuvre la traçabilité numérique sur au moins 70 % de la superficie cultivée. <span style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&sect;</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Production cible d\'ici 2031 :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>15 000 à 25 000 tonnes métriques de biomasse brute annuelle.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">10.2. Objectif d\'infrastructure de transformation et de fabrication avancées<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"> </span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Déployer plus de 40 millions USD de capital d\'amorçage dans une infrastructure agro-biotechnologique avancée.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Domaines d\'allocation du capital :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">A. Établissement des installations</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Investissement dans :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Construction et mise en service d\'une installation de qualité BPF (conception multi-zones)<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Établissement de salles blanches classées ISO essentiellement pour :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -14.4pt; mso-list: l7 level2 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Traitement post-récolte, extraction, concentration, purification chromatographique et séchage des composés bioactifs d\'origine végétale</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -14.4pt; mso-list: l7 level2 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Encapsulation et compression en comprimés</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -14.4pt; mso-list: l7 level2 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Remplissage des flacons, scellage et étiquetage des flacons, profilage et standardisation, mise en boîte et conditionnement en carton</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">B. Systèmes de lignes de fabrication</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Investissement dans :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Un système de ligne clé en main entièrement intégré et automatisé d\'extraction assistée par ultrasons (UAE), de production de gélules, de compression de comprimés et de conditionnement, personnalisé pour fabriquer :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l5 level2 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->MTCAs (Médecines Traditionnelles, Complémentaires et Alternatives)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l5 level2 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 2.0pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Nutraceutiques/Compléments Alimentaires</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l5 level2 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 1.85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Phytomédicaments</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l5 level2 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Phytopharmaceutiques</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Un système de ligne clé en main entièrement intégré et automatisé, conçu spécifiquement pour :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 36.0pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l5 level2 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Lait de Soja Liquide Fortifié</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l5 level2 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Poudre de Lait de Soja Instantané Fortifiée</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l5 level2 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Tofu Séché sous Vide Fortifié<span style=\"color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Un système de ligne clé en main entièrement intégré et automatisé, conçu spécifiquement pour la production et la récolte de la spiruline, ainsi que la transformation en poudre, gélules et comprimés, et le conditionnement :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 18.0pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l5 level2 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Poudre d\'Algue Spiruline Fortifiée et Micronisée (Complément Alimentaire)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l5 level2 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Gélules d\'Algue Spiruline Fortifiées (Complément Alimentaire)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l5 level2 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Comprimés d\'Algue Spiruline Fortifiés (Complément Alimentaire)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 18.0pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Un système de ligne de presse à froid clé en main entièrement intégré et automatisé, conçu spécifiquement pour la transformation et le conditionnement des jus :<span style=\"color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l5 level2 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Jus de Fruits Pressés à Froid Fortifiés<span style=\"color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Un système de ligne de transformation et de fabrication entièrement intégré et automatisé pour les engrais organiques haute-nutrition :<span style=\"color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 18.0pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l5 level2 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Concentrés liquides (par évaporation sous vide) d\'engrais organique</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l5 level2 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Poudre micronisée<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 36.0pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">C. Équipement de laboratoire avancé</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Investissement essentiellement dans :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Un laboratoire de recherche analytique et scientifique, doté d\'outils analytiques et de recherche avancés, incluant des instruments de qualité biotechnologique, tels que :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Chromatographie Liquide à Ultra-Haute Performance (UHPLC-MS/MS)<span style=\"color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Spectrométrie de Masse Tandem par Chromatographie en Phase Gazeuse Triple Quadrupôle (GC-MS/MS 8000)<span style=\"color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Spectromètre d\'Absorption Atomique à Haute Performance (HPAAS)<span style=\"color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Microscope à Balayage Laser AH SN600<span style=\"color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Quant Studio 5 (RT-qPCR)<span style=\"color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Cytomètre en Flux Numérique à Hauts Paramètres<span style=\"color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm 1.3pt 0cm;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Pour : le profilage et la standardisation des produits pour le contrôle qualité, la sécurité et l\'efficacité, ainsi que pour les essais précliniques et cliniques<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>Crédibilité sur les marchés régionaux et internationaux. <span style=\"color: red;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">10.3. Objectif de développement du portefeuille de produits</strong> D\'ici 2031, commercialiser :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">A. MTCAs standardisées</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">MTCAs (Adaptations de Médecines Traditionnelles, Complémentaires et Alternatives), plus de 20 formulations botaniques standardisées, testées en stabilité et traçables par lot.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: -17.05pt; line-height: 107%; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt 17.05pt;\" align=\"left\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">B.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Nutraceutiques &amp; Compléments Alimentaires </strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Plus de 15 compléments alimentaires soutenus par des preuves, produits clean-label et sans additifs synthétiques.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: -17.05pt; line-height: 107%; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt 17.05pt;\" align=\"left\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">C.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Aliments Fonctionnels &amp; Boissons Fortifiés </strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Dérivés de fruits et légumes riches en nutriments, boissons santé enrichies en botaniques.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">D. Phytomédicaments &amp; Phytopharmaceutiques basés sur des essais cliniques</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Validation préclinique via l\'installation de recherche animale, au moins 3 programmes d\'essais cliniques initiés d\'ici 2030.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Ciblage des maladies aiguës et chroniques (métaboliques, inflammatoires, liées au système immunitaire).</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">10.4. Objectif de certification Qualité, BPF &amp; ISO</strong> D\'ici 2029 :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Obtenir la certification ISO 9001.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Obtenir la certification ISO 22000.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Mettre en œuvre un système complet de documentation BPF et de procédures opérationnelles standardisées (SOP).</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Établir un système de pharmacovigilance et de surveillance post-commercialisation.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Obtenir les approbations réglementaires pour la commercialisation nationale.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Préparer les dossiers d\'exportation pour les marchés régionaux (COMESA/SADC).</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Cela garantit la préparation à une entrée sur le marché pharmaceutique international.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">10.5. Objectif de performance financière et commerciale</strong> D\'ici 2031 :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Chiffre d\'affaires annuel : 15 à 25 millions USD</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Marge brute &ge; 45%</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->EBITDA &ge; 22%</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm 1.95pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Flux de trésorerie positif dès la 3ème année suivant la mise en service</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Part des exportations &ge; 30% du chiffre d\'affaires total.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">10.6. Objectif d\'impact socio-économique et ESG</h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Plus de 500 emplois industriels qualifiés directs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->5 000 à 10 000 moyens de subsistance ruraux indirects.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm 2.3pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Participation des jeunes et des femmes &ge; 60%. <span style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&uuml;</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Augmentation des revenus des agriculteurs de 30 à 50%.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Agriculture régénératrice améliorant la teneur en carbone du sol d\'au moins 20%.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">Clarification sur l\'utilisation du capital d\'amorçage de plus de 40 millions USD</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Le capital d\'amorçage de plus de 40 millions USD sera alloué de manière stratégique comme suit :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Fourchette d\'allocation estimée :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level2 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Construction d\'installations conformes aux BPF : 25&ndash;35%</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level2 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Équipement de laboratoire avancé : 15&ndash;20%</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level2 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Lignes de transformation et de fabrication : 20&ndash;30%</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level2 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Salles blanches et zones stériles : 8&ndash;12%</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level2 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Certification et conformité réglementaire : 3&ndash;5%</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level2 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Fonds de roulement : 10&ndash;15%</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Ce niveau de capitalisation positionne NUFOTEC non pas comme une petite entreprise de phytothérapie, mais comme une plateforme industrielle régionale d\'agro-biotechnologie et de phytopharmaceutiques.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Changement de positionnement stratégique</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Avec une capitalisation de plus de 40 millions USD, NUFOTEC passe de :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 203.55pt .85pt 18.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&uuml;</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Transformation agroalimentaire initiale &rarr; transformation à grande échelle<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&uuml;</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Plateforme industrielle phytopharmaceutique régionale.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'Contactez-nous', NULL, NULL, NULL, '#contact', 10, '2026-03-01 20:50:42', 'strategic-summary', '{\"tag\": \"Vision 2031\", \"highlight_text\": \"Vision 2026-2031 : Construire la plateforme phytopharmaceutique de pointe en Afrique\", \"bg_style\": \"gradient-accent\"}', '2026-03-03 00:26:56', '2026-03-03 00:26:56', 1),
(199, 2, 'grille', 'Changement de positionnement stratégique', NULL, 'Strategic positioning shift', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\r\n  {\"type\": \"comparison\", \"from\": \"Transformation agroalimentaire initiale\", \"to\": \"Transformation à grande échelle\", \"from_icon\": \"arrow-right\", \"to_icon\": \"building\"},\r\n  {\"type\": \"comparison\", \"from\": \"Acteur régional\", \"to\": \"Plateforme industrielle phytopharmaceutique\", \"from_icon\": \"shop\", \"to_icon\": \"globe\"}\r\n]', NULL, '[\n  {\"type\": \"comparison\", \"from\": \"Initial agri-food processing\", \"to\": \"Large-scale processing\", \"from_icon\": \"arrow-right\", \"to_icon\": \"building\"},\n  {\"type\": \"comparison\", \"from\": \"Regional player\", \"to\": \"Regional phytopharmaceutical industrial platform\", \"from_icon\": \"shop\", \"to_icon\": \"globe\"}\n]', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 18, '2026-03-01 20:51:44', 'positioning-shift', '{\"layout\": \"comparison\", \"show_arrow\": true}', '2026-03-02 16:46:31', '2026-03-02 16:46:31', 1);
INSERT INTO `sections_contenu` (`id_section`, `id_page`, `type_section`, `titre_section`, `titre_section_fr`, `titre_section_en`, `titre_section_sw`, `sous_titre`, `sous_titre_fr`, `sous_titre_en`, `sous_titre_sw`, `contenu_texte`, `contenu_texte_fr`, `contenu_texte_en`, `contenu_texte_sw`, `image_url`, `image_droite`, `bouton_texte`, `bouton_texte_fr`, `bouton_texte_en`, `bouton_texte_sw`, `bouton_lien`, `ordre`, `created_at`, `custom_class`, `options_json`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `est_active`) VALUES
(200, 2, 'texte', 'OBJECTIFS', NULL, 'OBJECTIVES', NULL, 'Instruments analytiques et de recherche de pointe pour le contrôle qualité et la standardisation', NULL, 'State-of-the-art analytical and research instruments for quality control and standardization', NULL, '<h3 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">1. Objectif global</span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Suite au déploiement stratégique de plus de 40 millions USD de capital d\'amorçage, AFRICAN GREEN FARMERS (NUFOTEC) Limited aura entièrement construit et mis en service l\'installation NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>en tant que plateforme de fabrication agro-biotechnologique conforme aux BPF, produisant essentiellement sept (7) catégories de MTCAs standardisées, de</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Nutraceutiques/Compléments Alimentaires, de produits alimentaires et boissons santé fortifiés clean-label, d\'engrais organiques haute-nutrition, de phytomédicaments et phytopharmaceutiques basés sur la recherche préclinique, générant des opportunités d\'emploi et des revenus durables sur les marchés nationaux tout en obtenant des certifications ISO, nous qualifiant pour une expansion à l\'exportation régionale et internationale, visant un chiffre d\'affaires annuel de plusieurs millions de dollars, une performance EBITDA durable et une expansion des exportations scalable d\'ici 2031 (Vision 2026-2031).</span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6.55pt -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">2. Objectifs spécifiques</span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 22.55pt; text-indent: -22.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">(1)</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Établir une installation NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES conforme aux BPF, dotée de normes de fabrication en salle blanche certifiées ISO</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 22.55pt; text-indent: -22.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">(2)</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Développer des formulations standardisées de MTCAs, de Nutraceutiques/Compléments Alimentaires, de produits phytochimiques et phytopharmaceutiques, de produits alimentaires et boissons santé fortifiés clean-label</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 22.55pt; text-indent: -22.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">(3)</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Intégrer la biotechnologie de fermentation pour les engrais organiques haute-nutrition</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 22.55pt; text-indent: -22.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">(4)</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Mettre en place un laboratoire de recherche analytique et scientifique, ainsi que des outils analytiques et de recherche avancés, incluant des instruments de qualité biotechnologique tels que :</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 62.1pt; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Chromatographie Liquide à Ultra-Haute Performance (UHPLC-MS/MS)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 62.1pt; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Spectrométrie de Masse Tandem par Chromatographie en Phase Gazeuse Triple Quadrupôle (GC-MS/MS 8000)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 62.1pt; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Spectromètre d\'Absorption Atomique à Haute Performance (HPAAS)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 62.1pt; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Microscope à Balayage Laser AH SN600, Quant Studio 5 (RT-qPCR) et <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 62.1pt; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Cytomètre en Flux Numérique à Hauts Paramètres<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>fortement recommandés pour le profilage et la standardisation des produits, ainsi que pour les essais précliniques et cliniques</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 22.55pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 22.55pt; text-indent: -22.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">(5)</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Mettre en place une installation de recherche animale préclinique où les animaux de laboratoire (par exemple, des souris)<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>sont hébergés, élevés et utilisés dans des conditions de recherche scientifique contrôlées pour générer des données précliniques scientifiquement validées et conformes à la réglementation, prouvant qu\'un produit est sûr, efficace et standardisé avant son administration à l\'homme</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 22.55pt; text-indent: -22.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">(6)</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Entreprendre la culture biologique à l\'échelle commerciale de plantes médicinales, de cultures fonctionnelles, de fruits et légumes pour une production durable de matières premières</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 22.55pt; text-indent: -22.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">(7)</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Obtenir les approbations réglementaires nationales, régionales et internationales<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 22.55pt; text-indent: -22.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">(8)</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Développer la fabrication axée sur l\'exportation pour une intégration sur les marchés national, régional et international</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">ii. Objectifs stratégiques spécifiques (2026&ndash;2031)</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">1. Objectif d\'expansion de l\'agriculture biologique commerciale</span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Développer la culture biologique commerciale climato-intelligente de cultures médicinales et fonctionnelles à haute valeur ajoutée.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Phase I (2026&ndash;2027)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 13.55pt; text-indent: -13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&sect;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Opérationnaliser les 90 hectares déjà acquis.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 51.5pt .85pt 18.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&uuml;</span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Cultiver des plantes médicinales prioritaires, notamment Carica papayaya et l\'aloe vera </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&uuml;</span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Mettre en place des systèmes d\'irrigation, de gestion post-récolte et de séchage.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Phase II (2028&ndash;2031)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 13.55pt; text-indent: -13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&sect;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Expansion à plus de 2 000 hectares (exploitation propre + agriculture contractuelle).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 13.55pt; text-indent: -13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&sect;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Intégrer plus de 5 000 producteurs sous contrat.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; margin: 0cm 2.8pt 2.0pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&sect;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Atteindre la conformité biologique certifiée (normes régionales/internationales).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 13.55pt; text-indent: -13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&sect;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Mettre en œuvre la traçabilité numérique sur au moins 70 % de la superficie cultivée. </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&sect;</span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Production cible d\'ici 2031 :</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>15 000 à 25 000 tonnes métriques de biomasse brute annuelle.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">2. Objectif d\'infrastructure de transformation et de fabrication avancées</span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"> </span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Déployer plus de 40 millions USD de capital d\'amorçage dans une infrastructure agro-biotechnologique avancée.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Domaines d\'allocation du capital :</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">A. Établissement des installations</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Investissement dans :</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">1)</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Construction et mise en service d\'une installation de qualité BPF (conception multi-zones)<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">2)</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Établissement de salles blanches classées ISO essentiellement pour :</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 45.0pt; text-indent: -14.4pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&sect;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Traitement post-récolte, extraction, concentration, purification chromatographique et séchage des composés bioactifs d\'origine végétale</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 45.0pt; text-indent: -14.4pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&sect;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Encapsulation et compression en comprimés</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 45.0pt; text-indent: -14.4pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&sect;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Remplissage des flacons, scellage et étiquetage des flacons, profilage et standardisation, mise en boîte et conditionnement en carton</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">B. Systèmes de lignes de fabrication</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%; color: red;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Investissement dans :</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">1)</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Un système de ligne clé en main entièrement intégré et automatisé d\'extraction assistée par ultrasons (UAE), de production de gélules, de compression de comprimés et de conditionnement, personnalisé pour fabriquer :</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 30.15pt; text-indent: -13.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">MTCAs (Médecines Traditionnelles, Complémentaires et Alternatives)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 2.8pt 2.0pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Nutraceutiques/Compléments Alimentaires</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 2.8pt 1.85pt 30.15pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Phytomédicaments</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 30.15pt; text-indent: -13.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Phytopharmaceutiques</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">2)</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Un système de ligne clé en main entièrement intégré et automatisé, conçu spécifiquement pour :</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 30.15pt; text-indent: -13.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 10