line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">C. Équipement de laboratoire avancé</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Investissement essentiellement dans :</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Un laboratoire de recherche analytique et scientifique, doté d\'outils analytiques et de recherche avancés, incluant des instruments de qualité biotechnologique, tels que :</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 30.15pt; text-indent: -13.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Chromatographie Liquide à Ultra-Haute Performance (UHPLC-MS/MS)</span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 30.15pt; text-indent: -13.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Spectrométrie de Masse Tandem par Chromatographie en Phase Gazeuse Triple Quadrupôle (GC-MS/MS 8000)</span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 30.15pt; text-indent: -13.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Spectromètre d\'Absorption Atomique à Haute Performance (HPAAS)</span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 30.15pt; text-indent: -13.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Microscope à Balayage Laser AH SN600</span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 30.15pt; text-indent: -13.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Quant Studio 5 (RT-qPCR)</span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 30.15pt; text-indent: -13.45pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Cytomètre en Flux Numérique à Hauts Paramètres</span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1.3pt; line-height: 106%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Pour : le profilage et la standardisation des produits pour le contrôle qualité, la sécurité et l\'efficacité, ainsi que pour les essais précliniques et cliniques<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>Crédibilité sur les marchés régionaux et internationaux. </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; color: red;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%; margin: 0cm 2.8pt .15pt -.25pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">10.3. Objectif de développement du portefeuille de produits</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"> D\'ici 2031, commercialiser :</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">A. MTCAs standardisées</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">MTCAs (Adaptations de Médecines Traditionnelles, Complémentaires et Alternatives), plus de 20 formulations botaniques standardisées, testées en stabilité et traçables par lot.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -17.05pt; line-height: 106%; margin: 0cm 2.8pt .15pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 106%;\">B.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 106%;\">&nbsp; </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Nutraceutiques &amp; Compléments Alimentaires </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Plus de 15 compléments alimentaires soutenus par des preuves, produits clean-label et sans additifs synthétiques.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -17.05pt; line-height: 106%; margin: 0cm 2.8pt .15pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 106%;\">C.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 106%;\">&nbsp; </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Aliments Fonctionnels &amp; Boissons Fortifiés </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Dérivés de fruits et légumes riches en nutriments, boissons santé enrichies en botaniques.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">D. Phytomédicaments &amp; Phytopharmaceutiques basés sur des essais cliniques</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Validation préclinique via l\'installation de recherche animale, au moins 3 programmes d\'essais cliniques initiés d\'ici 2030.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Ciblage des maladies aiguës et chroniques (métaboliques, inflammatoires, liées au système immunitaire).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%; margin: 0cm 2.8pt .15pt -.25pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">4. Objectif de certification Qualité, BPF &amp; ISO</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"> D\'ici 2029 :</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 1