amily: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">EBITDA &ge; 22%</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; margin: 0cm 2.8pt 1.95pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&uuml;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Flux de trésorerie positif dès la 3ème année suivant la mise en service</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&uuml;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Part des exportations &ge; 30% du chiffre d\'affaires total.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">6. Objectif d\'impact socio-économique et ESG</span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&uuml;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Plus de 500 emplois industriels qualifiés directs.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&uuml;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">5 000 à 10 000 moyens de subsistance ruraux indirects.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; margin: 0cm 2.8pt 2.3pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&uuml;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Participation des jeunes et des femmes &ge; 60%. </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&uuml;</span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Augmentation des revenus des agriculteurs de 30 à 50%.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&uuml;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Agriculture régénératrice améliorant la teneur en carbone du sol d\'au moins 20%.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Clarification sur l\'utilisation du capital d\'amorçage de plus de 40 millions USD</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Le capital d\'amorçage de plus de 40 millions USD sera alloué de manière stratégique comme suit :</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 13.55pt; text-indent: -13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&sect;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Fourchette d\'allocation estimée :</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 31.55pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Construction d\'installations conformes aux BPF : 25&ndash;35%</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 31.55pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Équipement de laboratoire avancé : 15&ndash;20%</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 31.55pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Lignes de transformation et de fabrication : 20&ndash;30%</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 31.55pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Salles blanches et zones stériles : 8&ndash;12%</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 31.55pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Certification et conformité réglementaire : 3&ndash;5%</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 31.55pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&Oslash;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Fonds de roulement : 10&ndash;15%</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Ce niveau de capitalisation positionne NUFOTEC non pas comme une petite entreprise de phytothérapie, mais comme une plateforme industrielle régionale d\'agro-biotechnologie et de phytopharmaceutiques.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 13.55pt; text-indent: -13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&sect;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 103%; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Changement de positionnement stratégique</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 106%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Avec une capitalisation de plus de 40 millions USD, NUFOTEC passe de :</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 203.55pt .85pt 18.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&uuml;</span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Transformation agroalimentaire initiale &rarr; transformation à grande échelle<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&uuml;</span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Plateforme industrielle phytopharmaceutique régionale.</span></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 5, '2026-03-01 20:52:30', 'equipment-showcase', '{\"tag\": \"Technologie\", \"card_style\": \"icon-top\", \"columns\": 3}', '2026-03-04 15:39:22', NULL, 1);
