51.35px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Director of Agricultural Operations<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.6546%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.35pt 0cm 0cm 5.2pt; height: 51.35px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt .1pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Master&rsquo;s degree in agricultural engineering </span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50.3623%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.35pt 0cm 0cm 5.2pt; height: 51.35px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"264\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Overseeing the crop/medicinal plant organic industrial farming </span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED Industries op&egrave;re sous une structure de gouvernance d\'entreprise bas&eacute;e sur les comp&eacute;tences et un leadership ex&eacute;cutif ax&eacute; sur la science, con&ccedil;ue pour garantir la transparence, la conformit&eacute; r&eacute;glementaire et une croissance industrielle durable. L\'entreprise est supervis&eacute;e par un Conseil d\'Administration professionnellement constitu&eacute; qui assure une supervision strat&eacute;gique, la supervision des risques et la protection des investisseurs. La direction ex&eacute;cutive est structur&eacute;e en fonctions sp&eacute;cialis&eacute;es couvrant les op&eacute;rations, la recherche scientifique, les finances, l\'assurance qualit&eacute; et le d&eacute;veloppement commercial. Les activit&eacute;s op&eacute;rationnelles sont organis&eacute;es en divisions distinctes couvrant l\'agriculture biologique commerciale, la transformation et la fabrication avanc&eacute;es, la recherche et l\'innovation, la conformit&eacute; r&eacute;glementaire et les services corporatifs. Des m&eacute;canismes ind&eacute;pendants d\'audit, de conformit&eacute; et de supervision ESG sont int&eacute;gr&eacute;s au cadre de gouvernance pour garantir la responsabilit&eacute;, l\'int&eacute;grit&eacute; institutionnelle et la r&eacute;silience &agrave; long terme de l\'entreprise.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -0.25pt; text-align: center;\">Administrative Structure</h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"TableGrid\" style=\"width: 94.9353%; margin-left: 0.05pt; border-collapse: collapse; height: 1079px;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.8667px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.53609%; border: 1pt solid black; background: rgb(178, 161, 199); padding: 0.35pt 0cm 0cm 5.2pt; height: 18.8667px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">NO </span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"