ing<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></em></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 32.6667px;\">\r\n<td style=\"height: 32.6667px;\" height=\"33\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl88\" style=\"height: 32.6667px;\"><strong><em>&sect;<span class=\"font6\"> Waste Management Licence- ZEMA</span></em></strong></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl70\" style=\"height: 32.6667px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl82\" style=\"height: 32.6667px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl73\" style=\"height: 32.6667px;\"><strong><em>&uuml;<span class=\"font5\"> Oversees compliance with labor<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></em></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 32.6667px;\">\r\n<td style=\"height: 32.6667px;\" height=\"33\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl88\" style=\"height: 32.6667px;\"><strong><em>&sect;<span class=\"font6\"> Site Approval Certificate- ZMRA</span></em></strong></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl70\" style=\"height: 32.6667px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl82\" style=\"height: 32.6667px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl73\" style=\"height: 32.6667px;\"><strong><em>&uuml;<span class=\"font5\"> Evaluates performance &amp; HR policies</span></em></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 32.6667px;\">\r\n<td style=\"height: 32.6667px;\" height=\"33\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl88\" style=\"height: 32.6667px;\"><strong><em><span class=\"font6\">&nbsp;Product Registration- ZMRA</span></em></strong></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl70\" style=\"height: 32.6667px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl82\" style=\"height: 32.6667px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl72\" style=\"height: 32.6667px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 44.8px;\">\r\n<td style=\"height: 44.8px;\" height=\"33\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl88\" style=\"height: 44.8px;\"><strong><em><span class=\"font6\">&nbsp;GMP Inspection- ZAMRA</span></em></strong></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl70\" style=\"height: 44.8px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl83\" style=\"height: 44.8p