eatment </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 3: Controlled anaerobic (Bioreactor) lactic fermentation<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 4: In-process monitoring (pH, temperature, CPU count, organic acid profile) </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 5: Microfiltration for initial microbial control </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 55.45pt .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 6: Vacuum evaporation (Concentration) at the reduced pressure of 40&deg;C into paste form Step 7: Vacuum drying<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 8: Micronization </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 9: Incorporation of Trehalose for LAB stabilization </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 10: High-pressure processing (HPP) Optimization (40&deg;C) </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 11: Profiling and standardization </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 12: Aseptic packaging into moisture-proof aluminum 0.5k, 1, 5 &amp; 10kg sachets and 1-5kg HDPE<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>bottles </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 13: Nitrogen flashing </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 14: Bottle capping and sealing </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 15: Instructional labeling and batch coding </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 16: Case packaging </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language